        "end_value": {
          "card": "0..1",
          "doc": "Optional, default is 100. Determines to which value modifier should still be applying/scaling. I.e. if set to 90, it will scale to 100% for anything above 90. If set to a value lower than start_value it will work like a reverse_scaled_modifier",
